  "topic_en": "Euler finishes the example N = 385, showing that 2^60 − 1 is divisible by 385 and how the work could have been shortened, then starts Example 10 (N = 311) with a table of successive reductions by powers of 2.",
  "transcription": "ergo $x=60$, ita vt formula $2^{60}-1$ diuiſibilis ſit per 385; quod etiam inde concludi potuiſſet, quod diuiſoris noſtri factores ſunt 5, 7, 11, quorum primus 5 eſt diuiſor formulae $2^{2}+1$, ſecundus 7 eſt formulae $2^{3}-1$; tertius 11 eſt formulae $2^{5}+1$; at formula per has tres diuiſibilis ſimplicior non datur quam $2^{60}-1$.\n\n§. 21. Videamus nunc, quomodo hae operationes contrahi potuiſſent. Tertia operatione prodiit poteſtas $2^{x-14}$ reſiduum dans 9; vnde eius quadratum $2^{2x-28}$ reſiduum praebet 81; cubus autem $2^{3x-42}$ praebet reſiduum 729, ſiue 344, ſiue $-41$; hinc quarta poteſtas $2^{4x-56}$ dabit reſiduum $-369$, ſiue $+16=2^{4}.1$. ergo per $2^{4}$ diuidendo poteſtas $2^{4x-60}$ dat reſiduum $+1$. et diuidendo per $2^{4x}$, cuius reſiduum etiam eſt $+1$, poteſtas $2^{-60}$ reſiduum dabit $+1$, vti modo inuenimus.\n\nExemplum 10.\n\n§. 22. Sit $N=311$. fietque:\n$1+311=+312=2^{3}.39$ . . . 3\n$39-311=-272=-2^{4}.17$ . . . 7\n$-17-311=-328=-2^{3}.41$ . . . 10\n$-41-311=-352=-2^{5}.11$ . . . 15\n$-11+311=+300=+2^{2}.75$ . . . 17\n$+75-311=-236=-2^{2}.59$ . . . 19\n$-59+311=+252=+2^{2}.63$ . . . 21\n$+63-311=-248=-2^{3}.31$ . . . 24\n$-31+311=+280=+2^{3}.35$ . . . 27\n$+35-311=-276=-2^{2}.69$ . . . 29\n$-69-311=-380=-2^{2}.95$ . . . 31\n$-95$\n\n[p. 255]\n$-95+311=+216=+2^{3}.27$ . . 34\n$+27-311=-284=-2^{2}.71$ . . 36\n$-71+311=+240=+2^{4}.15$ . . 40\n$+15-311=-296=-2^{3}.37$ . . 43\n$-37-311=-348=-2^{2}.87$ . . 45\n$-87+311=+224=+2^{5}.7$ . . 50\n$+7-311=-304=-2^{4}.19$ . . 54\n$-19+311=+292=+2^{2}.73$ . . 56\n$+73+311=+384=+2^{7}.3$ . . 63\n$+3-311=-308=-2^{2}.77$ . . 65\n$-77-311=-388=-2^{2}.97$ . . 67\n$-97-311=-408=-2^{3}.51$ . . 70\n$-51+311=+260=+2^{2}.65$ . . 72\n$+65+311=+376=+2^{3}.47$ . . 75\n$+47-311=-264=-2^{3}.33$ . . 78\n$-33-311=-344=-2^{3}.43$ . . 81\n$-43+311=+268=+2^{2}.67$ . . 83\n$+67-311=-244=-2^{2}.61$ . . 85\n$-61-311=-372=-2^{2}.93$ . . 87\n$-93-311=-404=-2^{2}.101$ . . 89\n$-101-311=-412=-2^{2}.103$ . . 91\n$-103+311=+208=+2^{4}.13$ . . 95\n$+13+311=+324=+2^{2}.81$ . . 97\n$+81+311=+392=+2^{3}.49$ . . 100\n$+49+311=+360=+2^{3}.45$ . . 103\n$+45+311=-356=-2^{2}.89$ [?] . . 105\n$-89-311=-400=-2^{4}.25$ . . 109\n$-25-311=-336=-2^{4}.21$ . . 113\n$-21-311=-332=-2^{2}.83$ . . 115\n$-83+311=+228=+2^{2}.57$ . . 117\n$+57+311=+368=+2^{4}.23$ . . 121\n$+23$",
